msgid "### PR selective testing (CI)"
msgstr "### PR选择性测试（CI）"

msgid ""
"The PR CI workflow ([pr_test.yaml](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/.github/workflows/pr_test.yaml)) does not run the full "
"suite on every PR. It selects tests with a coverage/AST based precision-"
"testing pipeline and routes them to NPU runners. Tests run when the PR has "
"the `ready-precise` label (recommended subset) or the `ready-all` label "
"(full suite)."
msgstr ""
"PR CI工作流（[pr_test.yaml](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/.github/workflows/pr_test.yaml)）不会在每个PR上运行完整测试套件。它通过基于覆盖率/AST的精确测试流水线选择测试，并将其路由到NPU运行器。当PR带有`ready-"
"precise`标签（推荐子集）或`ready-all`标签（完整套件）时，测试才会运行。"

msgid "How tests are selected:"
msgstr "测试选择方式："

msgid ""
"1. `test_selector.py` builds a mapping of test cases to the source lines they cover from historical CI coverage data, then recommends the tests affected by the PR's changed lines (line → function → file granularity fallback).\n"
"2. `select_tests.py` routes each recommended test path to a runner by directory convention (`tests/ut/<module>/` → CPU, `tests/ut/<module>/a2/` → A2, `tests/e2e/pull_request/{one,two,four,eight}_card/` → A3, `_310p` → 310P), balances the load via estimated times, and emits the CI matrix."
msgstr ""
"1. `test_selector.py`根据历史CI覆盖率数据构建测试用例与其覆盖的源代码行的映射关系，然后推荐受PR变更行影响的测试（行→函数→文件粒度逐级回退）。\n"
"2. `select_tests.py`根据目录约定（`tests/ut/<module>/` → CPU，`tests/ut/<module>/a2/` → A2，`tests/e2e/pull_request/{one,two,four,eight}_card/` → A3，`_310p` → 310P）将每个推荐的测试路径路由到相应的运行器，通过预估时间平衡负载，并生成CI矩阵。"

msgid ""
"Adding a new test requires no configuration change: place the UT file under the\n"
"matching `tests/ut/<module>[/<npu>]` directory or the E2E file under the matching\n"
"`tests/e2e/pull_request/<card>` directory, and CI picks it up automatically from\n"
"the test tree. Routing metadata (runner mapping, partitions, estimated times)\n"
"lives in [`.github/workflows/scripts/test_config.yaml`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/.github/workflows/scripts/test_config.yaml)."
msgstr ""
"添加新测试无需修改配置：将UT文件放在对应的`tests/ut/<module>[/<npu>]`目录下，或将E2E文件放在对应的`tests/e2e/pull_request/<card>`目录下，CI会自动从测试树中识别。路由元数据（运行器映射、分区、预估时间）位于[`.github/workflows/scripts/test_config.yaml`](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/.github/workflows/scripts/test_config.yaml)中。"

msgid ""
